Package: seqmed
Title: Sequential Mediation Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ruijie", "Li", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "ruijie@leefy.net")
Description: Causal mediation analysis for sequential mediators using
    simulation-based and model-based approaches. Decomposes total effects
    into direct and indirect effects through one or more mediators.
    Provides bootstrap confidence intervals for model-based estimates and
    simulation-based inference with sensitivity analysis for unmeasured
    confounding.
